Name: Cursory
URL: https://github.com/Vinyzu/cursory
Version: 2.1.0
Revision: v2.1.0
Date: 2026-10-28
License: LGPL v3
License File: LICENSE, COPYING
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Recorded human mouse trajectories and the path generator built on them, used
to move the cursor along a human-looking path for CDP-injected mouse moves.
The code is a C++ port; the trajectory data is Cursory's.

Local Modifications:
C++ port of the Python original; trajectories repacked as int16/uint16
tables; SplitMix64 instead of numpy's random source; movement time fitted into
the configured [min, max] and capped at 10 s; equal-millisecond points
de-duplicated; timing resampled with a 1 ms jitter floor. See NOTICE.
Relinking instructions: RELINK.md.
